# id|type|target|message|sfxId|power|durationTurns
# durationTurns is optional — omit or set 0 for non-duration moves
#
# BALANCE REFERENCE
# Forest enemies:  5-7 base damage.  Power 1.0 = 5-7 dmg. Party HP ~30-55.
# Castle enemies: 10-15 base damage. Power 1.0 = 10-15 dmg. Party HP ~50-80.
# Decay enemies:  20-25 base damage. Power 1.0 = 20-25 dmg. Party HP ~80-120.
#
# RANDOM_PARTY targets one member. ALL_PARTY hits everyone — keep power lower.
# Combo moves (e.g. SLAM + SLAM_DEBUFF) are listed together and assigned together
# in enemies.db so they fire in sequence on the same turn.

#RAW DAMAGE MOVES BASIC
CLAW|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature tears into the party with sharp claws!|bash_light|1.0|0
BITE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature lunges forward and bites viciously!|bash_light|1.3|0
WEAK_SWIPE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature makes a clumsy swipe!|bash_light|0.75|0
SWEEP|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature sweeps across the whole party!|bash_light|0.5|0
LUNGE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature hurls itself forward with reckless force!|bash_light|1.5|0
TAIL_WHIP|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature whips its tail across the entire party!|bash_light|0.45|0
GNAW|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature latches on and gnaws savagely!|bash_light|1.1|0
BRANCH_SPEAR|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature strikes forwards with one of its branches, piercing like a spear!|strike_long|2.0|0

#RAW DAMAGE MOVES INTERMEDIATE
UPPERCUT|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The hostile directly upper cuts your party member!|bash_light|1.8|0
BRICK_TOSS|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The entity levitates a brick and hurls it at a party member!|strike_long|2.2|0
SLAM|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature raises itself up and crashes down onto the party!|strike_long|0.9|0
FERAL_CHARGE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature lowers its head and charges at full speed!|strike_long|2.5|0
RAKING_BLOW|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature rakes across the party with jagged claws in a wide arc!|bash_light|0.8|0
CRUSHING_GRIP|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature seizes a party member and squeezes with terrible force!|strike_long|2.8|0
DOUBLE_STRIKE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature strikes twice in rapid succession before you can react!|bash_light|1.4|0
GREATSWORD_SLASH|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The knight lifts his sword in the air and angles it, striking the entire party!|strike_long|1.2|0

#RAW DAMAGE MOVES ADVANCED
DEATH_BLOW|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature winds up and delivers a devastating blow aimed to kill!|strike_long|3.5|0
APOCALYPSE_SWEEP|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature tears through the entire party in one catastrophic motion!|strike_long|1.8|0
BONE_SHATTER|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature strikes with such force it feels like something breaks!|strike_long|4.0|0
VOID_STRIKE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|Something dark and formless drives through the target like a needle!|strike_long|3.2|0
TREMOR_SLAM|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature strikes the ground with enough force to shake the earth beneath the party!|strike_long|1.6|0

#STUN MOVES BASIC
SCREECH|STUN|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature lets out a piercing screech!|bash_light|1|1
DREAD_HOWL|STUN|ALL_PARTY|The creature's dreadful howl freezes the party!|bash_light|1|1

#STUN MOVES INTERMEDIATE
PETRIFYING_GAZE|STUN|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature fixes a single target with a paralyzing stare!|bash_light|1|2
CONCUSSIVE_BLOW|STUN|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature delivers a blow aimed squarely at the head!|bash_light|1|1
SHOCKWAVE|STUN|ALL_PARTY|The creature unleashes a burst of force that staggers the entire party!|strike_long|1|1

#STUN MOVES ADVANCED
MIND_BREAK|STUN|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature invades the target's mind, leaving them unable to act!|bash_light|1|3
PARALYTIC_HOWL|STUN|ALL_PARTY|The creature's shriek reaches a frequency that locks every muscle in place!|bash_light|1|2

#POISON MOVES BASIC
VENOM_SPIT|POISON|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature spits a stream of venom — it burns where it lands!|bash_light|4.0|3
ROTTING_TOUCH|POISON|ALL_PARTY|The creature's decayed limbs brush across the party, leaving a foul toxin!|bash_light|2.5|2
ENVENOMED_STRIKE_POISON|POISON|RANDOM_PARTY|The wound festers — poison takes hold!|bash_light|3.5|3

#POISON MOVES INTERMEDIATE
TOXIC_CLOUD|POISON|ALL_PARTY|The creature exhales a thick cloud of toxic gas across the entire party!|bash_light|6.0|3
PLAGUE_BITE|POISON|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature's bite carries something deeply wrong — a creeping sickness sets in!|bash_light|8.0|2
INFECTIOUS_SLASH|POISON|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature's claws are coated in something foul — the wound festers immediately!|bash_light|7.0|3

#POISON MOVES ADVANCED
NECROTIC_AURA|POISON|ALL_PARTY|The creature radiates a decaying energy that rots everything it touches!|bash_light|12.0|4
VENOM_NOVA|POISON|ALL_PARTY|The creature detonates a burst of concentrated venom in all directions!|bash_light|15.0|3
DEATH_BLIGHT|POISON|RANDOM_PARTY|An ancient and virulent toxin is driven directly into the bloodstream!|bash_light|20.0|4

#DEBUFF MOVES BASIC
WEAKENING_HOWL|DEBUFF_DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature's haunting cry saps the party's resolve!|bash_light|0.6|2
BRITTLE_CURSE|DEBUFF_DEFENSE|ALL_PARTY|The creature rasps a curse — the party's skin feels paper-thin!|bash_light|0.55|3

#DEBUFF MOVES INTERMEDIATE
DEMORALIZE|DEBUFF_DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature unleashes a crushing display of force that breaks the party's fighting spirit!|bash_light|0.5|2
EXPOSE_WEAKNESS|DEBUFF_DEFENSE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature finds a gap in the target's guard and tears it wide open!|bash_light|0.45|3
CURSE_OF_FRAILTY|DEBUFF_DEFENSE|ALL_PARTY|The creature utters something guttural — the party's bones feel hollow!|bash_light|0.55|2
SUNDER|DEBUFF_DEFENSE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature batters relentlessly at one target, wearing down their defenses!|bash_light|0.5|3

#DEBUFF MOVES ADVANCED
ANNIHILATING_PRESENCE|DEBUFF_DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature's very existence drains the will to fight from all who face it!|bash_light|0.4|3
TOTAL_EXPOSURE|DEBUFF_DEFENSE|ALL_PARTY|The creature tears through every defense the party has — they stand completely open!|bash_light|0.35|3
ENTROPY_CURSE|DEBUFF_DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|Reality itself seems to work against the party as the creature's curse takes hold!|bash_light|0.45|4
SHATTER_GUARD|DEBUFF_DEFENSE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature focuses everything into destroying a single target's defenses utterly!|bash_light|0.3|3

#COMBO MOVES INTERMEDIATE
ENVENOMED_STRIKE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature drives a poison-laced claw deep into its target!|bash_light|1.5|0
WEAKENING_BITE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature bites down hard — and something in the wound drains the target's strength!|bash_light|1.8|0
WEAKENING_BITE_DEBUFF|DEBUFF_DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The venom from the bite seeps in, sapping the target's power!|bash_light|0.65|2

#COMBO MOVES ADVANCED
SHATTERING_SLAM|DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The creature drives into the entire party — bones crack and guards crumble!|strike_long|1.4|0
SHATTERING_SLAM_DEBUFF|DEBUFF_DEFENSE|ALL_PARTY|The force of the blow leaves the whole party vulnerable!|bash_light|0.5|2
PLAGUE_CRUSH|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature drives a festering limb into the target with full body weight!|strike_long|2.8|0
PLAGUE_CRUSH_POISON|POISON|RANDOM_PARTY|The wound ruptures — whatever was in that limb is now in the bloodstream!|bash_light|10.0|3
TERROR_STRIKE|DAMAGE|RANDOM_PARTY|The creature strikes with enough savagery to rattle the whole party's nerves!|strike_long|3.0|0
TERROR_STRIKE_DEBUFF|DEBUFF_DAMAGE|ALL_PARTY|The sheer violence of the blow shatters the party's confidence!|bash_light|0.55|2